      <data key="d4">"June 8, 2021 marks a significant milestone for Microsoft's deployment plans, indicating a specific timeline for their product release."</data>
      <data key="d5">"milestone, timeline"</data>
      <data key="d6">rgb-0093</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MICROSOFT&quot;" target="&quot;DOCUMENTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Documentation is a source of information for the deployment process, providing guidance and instructions for users and developers."</data>
      <data key="d5">"guidance, information source"</data>
      <data key="d6">rgb-0093</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;A PERSON WEARING A HEADSET&quot;" target="&quot;HOLOGRAM OF A HUMMINGBIRD&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A person wearing a headset interacts with the hologram of a hummingbird, likely experiencing a demonstration or training session."</data>
