    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MIXED-REALITY HEADSETS&quot;" target="&quot;AUGMENTED REALITY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Augmented reality is a key feature of the mixed-reality headsets, enhancing their functionality and user experience."</data>
